            "review_title": "Review at Sông - Seafood & Grill",
            "review_text": "Mai Thi Pham\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam\n477 contributions\n0\nBest seafood restaurant\nMar 2019 • Friends\nFull selection of seafood at Song. Seafood so fresh and delicious. Hot pot and crab rice super yummy. Highly recommend, with nice view by river, big\nrestaurant with a lot of private room. Big king crab and big lobster. Highly recommend for come and try seafood and vietnamese food at Song.\nWritten March 26, 2019\nSongvn\nThanks for your feedback. We hope you have enjoyed everything and we would love to welcome you and your family soon.\nWritten April 3, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
