            "review_text": "blacksuzz\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam\n4 contributions\n0\nMost AMAZING view at the river of HCMC and TOP Seafood\nJan 2019 • Family\nI have been to this restaurant by yesterday evening. This restaurant has a quite unique location, right at the river of HCMC, in district 2, opposite of Vinhomes Central Park.\n\nMy friends and me who live at the other side of the restaurant wanted to try it out because we see it from our apartment.\n\nIt is a vietnamese restaurant which has a huge range of seafood. the restaurant itself has 2 floors with amazing view at day and night! \nWe were also introduced to the VIP rooms which have different sizes for all kinds of groups.\n\nThe seafood is really delicious and the prices are totally affordable. People who love to have a fresh breeze coupled with the most amazing view in whole HCMC, while they dine should definitely check this place out!!!\n\nThe staff is also very friendly and helpful and they could communicate with us in English.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 3, 2019\nSongvn\nDear customer,\n\nThank you so much for the great review! We’re so happy you loved our restaurant and can’t wait to have you back at Sông!\nRead more\nWritten February 19, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
